prefix_rule(pattern=["/opt/homebrew/bin/zsh", "-lc", "gh pr create --draft --base main --head issue-7717-calendar-occurrence-range --title 'test: Reproduce calendar occurrence range leak' --body $'Refs nedap/caren3#7717\\n\\n## Summary\\n\\nAdds a failing regression test for the one-day Cupido request reported by Rene. The downstream Ons Client expansion currently produces 2,559 occurrences instead of one.\\n\\n## Why This Change is Necessary\\n\\nThe failure gives the fixing agent a stable, local reproduction of the calendar range leak. No production behavior changes in this PR.\\n\\n## Implementation Details\\n\\nThe test calls Caren\\047s calendar-occurrences API with `from=2026-08-26` and `to=2026-08-27`, then applies Ons Client\\047s documented all-day expansion. It asserts a single result and currently fails with `Actual: 2559`.\\n\\nThe included handoff records the verified Cupido to Ons Client to Caren trace and next steps.\\n\\n### Stakeholders\\n\\n- [ ] Stakeholders have been informed\\n\\n## Testing Instructions\\n\\n### For Support\\n\\n- [ ] Not applicable: test-only draft PR.\\n\\n### For Development\\n\\n- [ ] Run `rails test test/bugs/calendar_occurrence_range_regression_test.rb --verbose`.\\n- [ ] Confirm it currently fails with `Expected: 1` and `Actual: 2559`.'"], decision="allow")
